LibraShogi
Copyright 2026 kotenbu (LibraShogi contributors)

This product is developed from scratch for 天秤将棋 (Tenbin Shogi).
It contains no code, evaluation functions, weights, or game records from
any existing shogi engine (YaneuraOu, Apery, dlshogi, Lc0, Suisho, Stockfish,
fuseki-shogi-ai, fuseki-shogi-web, etc.).

